{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>【Now新聞台】立法會會議今日(11月11日)討論非專營巴士持續發展，以及優化電話卡實名登記制等議題。另外，香港國際警務學院開幕典禮，由行政長官李家超主持，保安局局長鄧炳強和警務處處長周一鳴主禮。</p><p>採訪日誌｜立法會討論非專營巴士持續發展等／香港國際警務學院開幕</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T23:49:11.062608+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T23:26:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T23:42:46.154209+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T23:42:46.154209+00:00","content_hash":"6f0f325b0d71ed8ae030b67584cce08c9e2dea281e297869031c706fbcfadfbf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}